#: ../../Flocculation/Floc_Design_Solution.rst:88
msgid ""
"**6) Calculate the actual length** of the flocculator channels. This must "
"meet two constraints. First, it must be less than or equal to the maximum "
"channel length. Second, the channel length is limited by the flocculator "
